# Workflows — request → PR flows per task type

> **Why this file exists:** turn "I have a task" into a runnable sequence with explicit
> exit criteria and approval gates. Workflows **orchestrate by link** — they point at the
> rules, contracts, and Definition of Done rather than copying them.

## Step fields
Every workflow lists steps as: **Goal · Action · Artifact · Exit · 🚦 Gate**. The input of
a step is the artifact of the previous step. **Gate** = stop and wait for human approval.

## Choose a workflow

| Signal | Task type | Workflow |
| --- | --- | --- |
| "Add / build / support X" | Feature | [feature.md](feature.md) |
| "Broken / wrong / fails" | Bug | [bug.md](bug.md) |
| Touches auth / migration / infra / external / anti-goal | **Gated** | [gated-change.md](gated-change.md) **first** |
